# YouTube Shorts Downloader

A lightweight Next.js app that lets users paste a public YouTube Shorts URL, view a video preview, and download the MP4 directly.

## Features

- Paste YouTube Shorts URL
- Fetch preview metadata
- Show thumbnail and basic video info
- Download MP4 file directly
- Vercel-ready Node.js server setup

## Local development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open: http://localhost:3000

## Deploy to Vercel

1. Push this repo to GitHub
2. Import it into Vercel
3. Vercel will detect Next.js automatically
4. Deploy

## Notes

- Works best with public videos
- Use only for videos you are allowed to download and save

## Important

This tool relies on YouTube metadata and streaming endpoints. Some videos may block download access or change their format feeds over time.
